The safety floor of the remediation plan: packages that the plan never touches, by function, each with
its source. Written by the Datapavan project and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015 and ADR 0026. The sources are
cited as evidence of what each package does or of what broke without it; nothing is copied from them.
